1
00:00:23,712 --> 00:00:28,451
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,451 --> 00:00:32,163
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,387 --> 00:00:34,632
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:34,979 --> 00:00:37,686
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,565 --> 00:00:43,093
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,093 --> 00:00:46,725
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,203 --> 00:00:50,691
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,835 --> 00:00:55,331
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,331 --> 00:00:59,971
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,359 --> 00:01:02,019
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,019 --> 00:01:07,971
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,163 --> 00:01:11,851
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,851 --> 00:01:15,422
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,587 --> 00:01:22,531
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:22,979 --> 00:01:26,600
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:30,284
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,371 --> 00:01:35,299
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,299 --> 00:01:39,459
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,328 --> 00:01:46,755
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,488 --> 00:01:49,955
=Episode 9=

21
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:52,009
(Barrier)

22
00:01:55,879 --> 00:01:58,799
(On the day of the wedding,
we'll meet at Fengcheng Station.)

23
00:02:02,439 --> 00:02:05,239
(Miss Jiang, forgive me.)

24
00:02:05,959 --> 00:02:07,239
(I had to do it.)

25
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:09,080
(Because)

26
00:02:09,759 --> 00:02:14,439
(after the Rongqing Troupe
was slaughtered, I became all alone,)

27
00:02:15,199 --> 00:02:16,399
(lingering in this world,)

28
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:18,624
(To Miss Jiang)
only for using Xu Fan's blood

29
00:02:18,624 --> 00:02:20,240
to avenge the Rongqing Troupe.

30
00:02:20,768 --> 00:02:24,759
(And the wedding
is the only chance I can kill him.)

31
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:25,759
Young Marshal.

32
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:27,000
The troops are all ready.

33
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,400
Send troops to protect Chun'er.

34
00:02:28,768 --> 00:02:31,759
The Governor Mansion is heavily guarded.
We still can't let our guard down.

35
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:32,599
Yes!

36
00:02:35,488 --> 00:02:37,216
♪If longing♪

37
00:02:37,216 --> 00:02:40,375
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

38
00:02:40,375 --> 00:02:43,130
♪How can I be at ease♪

39
00:02:43,232 --> 00:02:45,546
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

40
00:02:46,208 --> 00:02:47,616
(Chang'an)

41
00:02:47,616 --> 00:02:50,704
♪Scars all over me♪

42
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:53,639
I won't let anyone
control my life again.

43
00:02:55,392 --> 00:03:01,935
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

44
00:03:02,382 --> 00:03:04,579
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

45
00:03:06,479 --> 00:03:08,360
Bow to heaven and earth.

46
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,840
(I know I might not survive this.)

47
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:18,960
(It's shameful to do so,
but I have to ask you two favors.)

48
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:22,490
(After I die, if possible,)

49
00:03:23,424 --> 00:03:26,560
- (please bury my corpse with Master's.)
- Bow to each other.

50
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:29,400
(Also, please help me find Shitou.)

51
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,448
(I don't seek to reunite with him.)

52
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:36,960
- (I want to know if he is living well.)
- Good!

53
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:37,888
- Good!
- Good!

54
00:03:37,888 --> 00:03:38,560
Good!

55
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:39,719
(Take care.)

56
00:03:54,039 --> 00:03:55,280
Governor!

57
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,319
Governor!

58
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:06,960
Why are you here?

59
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:08,479
Where is Chun'er?

60
00:04:12,439 --> 00:04:16,240
This is my only chance to kill Xu Fan.

61
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:21,759
You assassinated Governor in public.
Are you seeking death?

62
00:04:22,048 --> 00:04:23,360
I know I committed a crime.

63
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:25,560
But I must get rid of him

64
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:30,879
to avenge Master
and everyone in the Rongqing Troupe.

65
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:32,600
Young Marshal.

66
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:35,399
Kill the murderer to avenge Governor!

67
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,279
Insolent!

68
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:43,439
Now, I am in charge here.

69
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:46,600
- You!
- Today, I have to protect Rong Xiaonan!

70
00:04:49,439 --> 00:04:52,399
Xu You'an, are you
rebelling against Governor?

71
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:53,800
What?

72
00:04:54,839 --> 00:04:57,199
The position of Governor is always mine.

73
00:04:57,824 --> 00:04:59,571
♪Candle by the west window♪

74
00:04:59,959 --> 00:05:00,959
Let him go.

75
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:05,212
♪Ending in nothingness♪

76
00:05:05,312 --> 00:05:07,079
♪I ask why♪

77
00:05:07,079 --> 00:05:08,000
Rong Xiaonan.

78
00:05:09,279 --> 00:05:11,480
You can survive today
not because you are lucky,

79
00:05:12,319 --> 00:05:15,240
but because on such a fine day,
I don't want to stain my hands.

80
00:05:18,079 --> 00:05:18,879
Get lost.

81
00:05:21,952 --> 00:05:27,566
♪No one comes to meet me♪

82
00:05:27,566 --> 00:05:29,152
♪Candle by the west window♪

83
00:05:30,399 --> 00:05:32,560
(You resemble Zhuzi so much.)

84
00:05:33,319 --> 00:05:34,592
(I will spare your life)

85
00:05:35,872 --> 00:05:41,024
(as a way to make amends for the regret
of not being able to save Zhuzi.)

86
00:05:42,311 --> 00:05:43,968
♪A handful of earth♪

87
00:05:44,096 --> 00:05:46,797
♪The world's last gamble♪

88
00:05:46,797 --> 00:05:50,016
♪Sighing at the late hour♪

89
00:05:55,839 --> 00:05:56,639
Quick makeup change!

90
00:05:57,512 --> 00:05:59,776
♪Dream of a big garden♪

91
00:05:59,776 --> 00:06:01,760
♪Under the plum tree♪

92
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:05,639
Keep your breathing steadier
at the high notes.

93
00:06:06,279 --> 00:06:07,160
Yes, Master.

94
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:08,600
I'll hold it steady.

95
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:10,879
Performing is like living.

96
00:06:11,199 --> 00:06:13,800
To reach the heights,
you must first go low.

97
00:06:14,079 --> 00:06:15,319
♪Without entering the garden♪

98
00:06:15,319 --> 00:06:18,959
♪How can I know the beauty of spring♪

99
00:06:20,288 --> 00:06:26,439
♪To express the feelings in dreams♪

100
00:06:26,439 --> 00:06:27,240
Fan.

101
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:32,480
Remember, your poses
must be sharp, clean,

102
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,319
and beautiful.

103
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:34,240
Okay.

104
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:40,156
♪Chunxiang, lead the way♪

105
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:42,879
- Look, Mr. Rong is coming out!
- Mr. Rong is coming out!

106
00:06:42,879 --> 00:06:45,120
- Mr. Rong!
- Good!

107
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:47,488
- Mr. Rong!
- Good!

108
00:06:47,488 --> 00:06:48,680
Mr. Rong!

109
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:08,587
(Rongqing Troupe)

110
00:07:18,399 --> 00:07:19,439
Master,

111
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,319
my fellows,

112
00:07:23,399 --> 00:07:29,959
now that I've avenged the great grudge,
why do I feel no sense of relief?

113
00:07:35,008 --> 00:07:36,512
When I slacked off in practice,

114
00:07:38,912 --> 00:07:42,839
you said I revealed a hint of cunning.

115
00:07:44,279 --> 00:07:45,439
You were right.

116
00:07:47,104 --> 00:07:52,199
You often said,
an actor must follow nine-fold rules.

117
00:07:54,016 --> 00:07:58,944
But for revenge,
I deceived and used Chun'er.

118
00:07:59,872 --> 00:08:02,912
I became the person I despise the most.

119
00:08:03,968 --> 00:08:07,959
I'm sinking deeper into schemes.

120
00:08:12,416 --> 00:08:16,959
(Tomb of respected master, Rong Huaiqiu)

121
00:08:16,959 --> 00:08:21,560
Master, do you still
acknowledge me as your disciple?

122
00:08:22,336 --> 00:08:25,888
(Tomb of respected master, Rong Huaiqiu)

123
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:35,840
(Master.)

124
00:08:37,519 --> 00:08:39,000
(I can't stay in Fengcheng anymore.)

125
00:08:40,759 --> 00:08:42,399
(I couldn't revive the Rongqing Troupe.)

126
00:08:43,799 --> 00:08:48,240
(Just consider it
as me skipping class again.)

127
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:58,112
(Tomb of respected master, Rong Huaiqiu)

128
00:08:59,104 --> 00:09:01,952
(Governor Mansion)

129
00:09:07,759 --> 00:09:11,279
Except me, no one can enter this room.

130
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:13,240
Yes!

131
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:16,240
Young...

132
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:17,200
Governor,

133
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:18,360
there's a guest here.

134
00:09:30,782 --> 00:09:32,256
(Du Xiaolin,
President of Xiaosheng Society)

135
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:33,639
Young Marshal Xu,

136
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:35,600
do you know who I am?

137
00:09:36,159 --> 00:09:38,840
As long as you know who I am.

138
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:47,200
Before, the Old Governor used artifacts
to trade with us for advanced weapons.

139
00:09:48,279 --> 00:09:51,049
If you can provide the items,

140
00:09:51,049 --> 00:09:55,559
the deal continues,
and all grudges will be wiped clean.

141
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:05,840
Provide you the items,
and the deal is done.

142
00:10:06,272 --> 00:10:10,432
Give me the Jade Buddha Head
and kingfisher phoenix crown.

143
00:10:10,624 --> 00:10:12,879
The ship with weapons
will arrive at the port soon.

144
00:10:13,344 --> 00:10:17,960
After all,
Fengcheng Port has long been ours.

145
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:27,440
See the guest out.

146
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:33,519
Please.

147
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:42,399
Darn it! How dare he negotiate terms!

148
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:43,399
Governor,

149
00:10:43,456 --> 00:10:44,799
I'll take men and wipe him out.

150
00:10:46,399 --> 00:10:49,240
I've just taken power,
it's not stable yet.

151
00:10:50,279 --> 00:10:51,840
Send someone to tail them

152
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:54,600
and wipe them all out
after investigation.

153
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:55,399
Yes!

154
00:11:03,919 --> 00:11:07,399
Father, I was wrong.

155
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:42,960
Master.

156
00:11:45,559 --> 00:11:46,360
Master.

157
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:47,600
Father!

158
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:49,600
Father!

159
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:51,159
Father!

160
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:53,519
Someone's dead!

161
00:11:53,519 --> 00:11:54,799
The Master is dead!

162
00:11:55,879 --> 00:11:56,576
Help!

163
00:12:15,712 --> 00:12:16,992
♪As if it were fate♪

164
00:12:16,992 --> 00:12:18,349
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

165
00:12:18,911 --> 00:12:22,148
♪We miss each other♪

166
00:12:23,392 --> 00:12:25,056
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

167
00:12:25,056 --> 00:12:27,360
♪And a bizarre♪

168
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:30,162
♪Anonymous legend♪

169
00:12:30,692 --> 00:12:32,704
♪The plot twists and turns♪

170
00:12:32,852 --> 00:12:34,592
♪Play out over and over again♪

171
00:12:34,592 --> 00:12:37,656
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

172
00:12:38,237 --> 00:12:39,936
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

173
00:12:39,936 --> 00:12:41,120
♪Refuse to submit♪

174
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:44,128
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

175
00:12:45,792 --> 00:12:48,704
♪There are always too many♪

176
00:12:48,704 --> 00:12:50,592
♪Helpless situations♪

177
00:12:50,592 --> 00:12:53,216
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

178
00:12:54,347 --> 00:12:56,307
♪Even if I have questions♪

179
00:12:56,307 --> 00:12:58,307
♪I harbor desires♪

180
00:12:58,307 --> 00:13:01,184
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

181
00:13:01,535 --> 00:13:03,168
♪People come and go♪

182
00:13:03,168 --> 00:13:05,984
♪I'm still all alone♪

183
00:13:05,984 --> 00:13:08,712
♪Wandering around♪

184
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:11,813
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

185
00:13:11,813 --> 00:13:16,274
♪Go through the entanglement♪

186
00:13:16,640 --> 00:13:18,368
♪If longing♪

187
00:13:18,368 --> 00:13:21,527
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

188
00:13:21,527 --> 00:13:24,282
♪How can I be at ease♪

189
00:13:24,384 --> 00:13:26,698
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

190
00:13:26,816 --> 00:13:28,672
♪And travelled around the world♪

191
00:13:28,768 --> 00:13:31,856
♪Scars all over me♪

192
00:13:32,128 --> 00:13:35,040
♪If longing never fades♪

193
00:13:35,040 --> 00:13:36,489
♪Burns still hot♪

194
00:13:36,489 --> 00:13:39,568
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

195
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:41,697
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

196
00:13:41,760 --> 00:13:43,072
♪In the next life♪

197
00:13:43,072 --> 00:13:47,488
♪Entangle with you again♪
